{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://fw.local/schemas/decisions.schema.json",
  "title": ".agents/decisions.yaml (user-owned decisions, project scope: U1 decided C on 2026-10-14 with conditions U1.a, U1.c, U1.d (revised 2026-10-27); U2 decided B with confirm_scope and non_interactive pr_only_tier2; U6 decided agentive:rubric@1 on 2026-10-15. /agentive:init writes all three; it asks no question for them)",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "U1",
    "U2",
    "U6"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "U1": {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/d"
        }
      ],
      "description": "U1=C requires conditions [U1.a, U1.c, U1.d] (U1.b post-merge sampling removed 2026-10-27; the id is never reused)",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "value": {
            "const": "C"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "conditions"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "conditions": {
            "const": [
              "U1.a",
              "U1.c",
              "U1.d"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "not": {
        "required": [
          "non_interactive"
        ]
      }
    },
    "U2": {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/d"
        }
      ],
      "description": "U2=B requires confirm_scope [hooks, permissions, ci, claude_settings, codex_dir, review_config] and non_interactive pr_only_tier2: a human confirms before commit only when the change touches one of these; when no human is present (no_human_run, revised 2026-10-27: AGENTIVE_HEADLESS=1, CI or GITHUB_ACTIONS, or permission_mode dontAsk in hook input that carries it; CLAUDE_CODE_REMOTE is not a signal; no signal = interactive: CI jobs, headless claude -p runs through the standard command, Routines runs whose cloud environment sets AGENTIVE_HEADLESS=1, janitor) such a change is never committed to the default branch or merged, only opened as a PR that RV4 forces to tier 2; every other change is committed automatically after all proofs pass",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "value": {
            "const": "B"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "confirm_scope",
          "non_interactive"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "confirm_scope": {
            "const": [
              "hooks",
              "permissions",
              "ci",
              "claude_settings",
              "codex_dir",
              "review_config"
            ]
          },
          "non_interactive": {
            "const": "pr_only_tier2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "U6": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "value",
        "decided_by"
      ],
      "description": "U6 decided 2026-10-15: the framework rubric preset agentive:rubric@<n> (5 binary items 24/24/24/14/14, score > 28 -> human). The project changes the rubric only through .agents/custom/.agents/rubric.yaml (schema rubric); this line records which preset the decision refers to",
      "properties": {
        "value": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^agentive:rubric@[0-9]+$"
        },
        "decided_by": {
          "const": "user"
        },
        "decided_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "note": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "d": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "value",
        "decided_by"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "value": {
          "enum": [
            "A",
            "B",
            "C",
            null
          ]
        },
        "decided_by": {
          "enum": [
            "user",
            null
          ],
          "description": "user: a human chose; null: undecided (no project decision may stay undecided after init)"
        },
        "decided_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "note": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "conditions": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^U[0-9]+\\.[a-z]$"
          },
          "uniqueItems": true
        },
        "confirm_scope": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "enum": [
              "hooks",
              "permissions",
              "ci",
              "claude_settings",
              "codex_dir",
              "review_config"
            ]
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "description": "U2=B: change categories that need human confirmation before commit"
        },
        "non_interactive": {
          "enum": [
            "pr_only_tier2"
          ],
          "description": "U2=B (decided_by user, 2026-10-14): behavior of a non-interactive run whose change touches confirm_scope. pr_only_tier2 = no direct commit to the default branch, no merge; open a PR only, forced to tier 2 (always human approval, never auto-merge). Not defined for U2=A or U2=C project overrides."
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "const": null
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "decided_by": {
                "const": null
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "u3": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "value",
        "decided_by"
      ],
      "description": "U3 (framework repo only; framework.yaml decisions.U3): in a local Claude Code session started by the framework author, what needs the author before commit. Decided B on 2026-10-14: confirm_scope [hooks, permissions, sandbox, security, release]; every other change is committed by Claude after all self_tests [generate_check, schema_validation, sample_repo_tests] pass. A (confirm every change) and C (no confirmation, self-tests only) take no confirm_scope. Any decided value requires the three self-tests.",
      "properties": {
        "value": {
          "enum": [
            "A",
            "B",
            "C",
            null
          ]
        },
        "decided_by": {
          "enum": [
            "user",
            null
          ]
        },
        "decided_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "note": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "confirm_scope": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "enum": [
              "hooks",
              "permissions",
              "sandbox",
              "security",
              "release"
            ]
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "description": "U3=B: change categories that need the author before commit (release = the version-bump commit)"
        },
        "self_tests": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "enum": [
              "generate_check",
              "schema_validation",
              "sample_repo_tests"
            ]
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "description": "self-tests that must pass before Claude commits; run only when the framework is edited (locally, CI on pull_request), never on a schedule"
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "const": null
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "decided_by": {
                "const": null
              }
            },
            "not": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "required": [
                    "confirm_scope"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "self_tests"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "enum": [
                  "A",
                  "B",
                  "C"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "self_tests"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "decided_by": {
                "const": "user"
              },
              "self_tests": {
                "const": [
                  "generate_check",
                  "schema_validation",
                  "sample_repo_tests"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "const": "B"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "confirm_scope"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "confirm_scope": {
                "const": [
                  "hooks",
                  "permissions",
                  "sandbox",
                  "security",
                  "release"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "enum": [
                  "A",
                  "C"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "not": {
              "required": [
                "confirm_scope"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "u4": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "value",
        "decided_by"
      ],
      "description": "U4 (framework repo only; framework.yaml decisions.U4): how the review criteria are kept. Decided C on 2026-10-14: one repo-owned file code_review.md referenced from AGENTS.md (criteria_file, referenced_from); both Claude Code and Codex reviewers read it, with no per-tool copies. A REVIEW.md copy for Claude managed Code Review (Team/Enterprise research preview) exists only as an opt-in: managed_code_review_copy_default is false and /agentive:init asks a plain yes/no whether to generate it (default answer No; the only question init asks, C-059) and stores the answer in .agents/framework.yaml review.managed_code_review_copy; /agentive:update never asks. CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md act as the fallback criteria only for changed files the criteria file does not govern: a criteria file applies only from an ancestor directory of the changed file, a changed file is never evaluated against both, and a file with no applicable criteria is a normal result (review-config criteria). A and B take none of the C fields.",
      "properties": {
        "value": {
          "enum": [
            "A",
            "B",
            "C",
            null
          ]
        },
        "decided_by": {
          "enum": [
            "user",
            null
          ]
        },
        "decided_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "note": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "criteria_file": {
          "const": "code_review.md",
          "description": "U4=C: the single review criteria file (holds the agentive-review-rules block)"
        },
        "referenced_from": {
          "const": "AGENTS.md",
          "description": "U4=C: AGENTS.md carries the line \"Review rules: @code_review.md\"; Claude Code reads it through the @import chain, Codex through the path reference"
        },
        "managed_code_review_copy_default": {
          "const": false,
          "description": "U4=C: a REVIEW.md copy is generated only when a project sets review.managed_code_review_copy to true; the default is false"
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "const": null
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "decided_by": {
                "const": null
              }
            },
            "not": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "required": [
                    "criteria_file"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "referenced_from"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "managed_code_review_copy_default"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "enum": [
                  "A",
                  "B",
                  "C"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "decided_by": {
                "const": "user"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "const": "C"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "criteria_file",
              "referenced_from",
              "managed_code_review_copy_default"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "value": {
                "enum": [
                  "A",
                  "B"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "not": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "required": [
                    "criteria_file"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "referenced_from"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "managed_code_review_copy_default"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
